{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12435","headline":"七盘岭阻寇闻李端公先到南楚 · 钱起","name":"七盘岭阻寇闻李端公先到南楚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日暮穷途泪满襟，云天南望羡飞禽。\n阮肠暗与孤鸿断，江水遥连别恨深。\n明月既能通忆梦，青山何用隔同心。\n秦楚眼看成绝国，相思一寄白头吟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}